[00:03.165]The wind is shining in the summer my sweet home
{"夏日的风正闪耀　我甜蜜的家"}
[00:07.980]I was the way you chased in your shadow my sweet world
{"我曾是你追逐的路　在你影中　我甜蜜的世界"}
[00:12.764]The sky that never only marks me my sweet heart
{"那片永不独属于我的天空　我甜蜜的心"}
[00:16.680]Wish you'll be by your side forever sweetest summer dream
{"愿你永远相伴身旁　最甜美的夏日之梦"}
[00:21.710]Day by day it's going to be a beautiful old day~
